WEBVTT

00:57.390 --> 01:01.019
THE WONDERFOOLS

01:02.645 --> 01:04.981
Excuse me? Nam Sun-gyu?

01:05.482 --> 01:08.193
You say he's working with
the Church of Eternal Salvation

01:08.276 --> 01:09.694
to do what?

01:10.487 --> 01:12.697
Abduct and confine.

01:25.502 --> 01:27.253
Illegal human experiments.

01:33.343 --> 01:34.427
What's going on?

01:37.097 --> 01:39.849
Goodness, ma'am,
why are you bringing up the past?

01:39.933 --> 01:42.060
That happened over 20 years ago.

01:42.143 --> 01:44.479
I'm telling you that
what happened 20 years ago

01:44.979 --> 01:47.565
is happening there again right now!

01:54.614 --> 01:56.616
We can just kill them all, right?

01:56.699 --> 01:58.827
Number 3972 is mine.

01:59.327 --> 02:00.495
Hands off.

02:45.165 --> 02:47.375
Mr. Oddball, what's wrong with you?

02:48.126 --> 02:50.795
You said you were rechargeable.
Are you out of juice?

02:51.379 --> 02:52.422
Master!

02:52.505 --> 02:53.464
Are you okay?

02:54.048 --> 02:57.093
This is not the time
for you to be spacing out.

02:57.177 --> 02:58.469
Come on, Mr. Oddball.

02:59.095 --> 03:00.471
Snap out of it!

03:05.685 --> 03:06.519
Boom boom pow?

03:22.952 --> 03:23.786
Barley.

03:29.792 --> 03:30.793
Barley.

03:34.631 --> 03:35.798
Rice!

03:37.550 --> 03:39.594
Barley.

03:42.013 --> 03:42.847
Wanna die?

03:42.931 --> 03:44.641
Don't do this.

03:45.308 --> 03:47.101
If you do, everyone will die.

03:56.986 --> 03:57.820
Barley.

04:00.323 --> 04:02.533
No matter how many times you try,
I'll stop you.

04:06.829 --> 04:09.415
How dare you get in the shepherd's way!

04:10.750 --> 04:13.503
If you're defective,
act like one and stay out of my way!

04:17.882 --> 04:20.093
You're a nobody,
yet you're trying to be a hero?

04:44.951 --> 04:46.244
Sure,

04:47.704 --> 04:49.580
people may call me Sappy Sap,

04:50.081 --> 04:53.459
and yeah, most people would agree
that I'm a nobody,

04:54.836 --> 04:57.714
but I won't sit back and let people die.

05:02.051 --> 05:03.303
Sorry.

05:05.096 --> 05:06.472
This is going to hurt.

05:22.905 --> 05:24.032
What's going on?

05:25.241 --> 05:28.077
Who are those punks,
and why are they causing such a ruckus?

05:28.911 --> 05:30.621
We'll deal with them.

05:31.205 --> 05:32.415
And the surgery?

05:34.125 --> 05:38.963
You lost the child with the eternal heart
from right under your nose!

05:39.964 --> 05:41.966
Finding her again won't be difficult.

06:06.199 --> 06:07.283
Help me.

06:11.621 --> 06:12.538
Help me.

06:35.937 --> 06:36.813
Don't!

06:45.321 --> 06:47.490
Help me!

06:47.573 --> 06:49.534
Please help us!

06:50.034 --> 06:52.620
Please save our brother!

06:53.329 --> 06:54.705
Please!

06:56.624 --> 06:57.625
Do you remember?

07:00.044 --> 07:01.712
How horrible it was?

07:03.714 --> 07:04.966
This is all your fault.

07:10.346 --> 07:13.391
You ruined everything.

07:13.474 --> 07:14.308
See it now?

07:25.403 --> 07:26.237
Stop.

07:27.447 --> 07:29.991
So what if we were experimented on
and it hurt?

07:30.074 --> 07:31.701
Nothing in life is free.

07:31.784 --> 07:33.953
You need to endure some pain to be loved!

07:36.122 --> 07:38.082
Even our birth parents abandoned us.

07:38.166 --> 07:42.003
Father was the only one
who ever called us family!

07:42.837 --> 07:44.046
It's all because of you!

07:44.672 --> 07:46.299
It's all your fault

07:46.382 --> 07:48.384
that we ended up like this!

07:48.468 --> 07:49.844
Stop it!

08:01.856 --> 08:03.399
Goddamn it,

08:03.483 --> 08:06.652
this is so unbearably fun!

08:08.362 --> 08:11.449
I'm having a goddamn blast!

08:18.789 --> 08:20.666
Chae-ni, are you okay?

08:20.750 --> 08:23.961
What's going on here? What happened?

08:24.045 --> 08:25.963
Something's up with Master!

08:27.131 --> 08:31.636
He suddenly ran out of juice,
and it looks like he's totally broken now.

08:32.386 --> 08:33.429
What?

08:39.977 --> 08:43.564
Freaking impeccable timing, if you ask me!

08:45.983 --> 08:50.863
My arm doesn't hurt one bit,
and this isn't tiring at all!

08:51.364 --> 08:54.116
Honestly!

08:56.077 --> 08:59.372
Ro-bin, push me forward!

08:59.455 --> 09:00.873
I can't hear you!

09:00.957 --> 09:02.291
Darn it!

09:13.427 --> 09:17.598
Master! Snap out of it!

09:21.352 --> 09:22.436
Master!

09:52.174 --> 09:53.426
That's enough.

09:54.302 --> 09:55.636
You can stop now.

10:03.978 --> 10:05.021
The truth is…

10:07.398 --> 10:08.733
I wanted to save him.

10:14.822 --> 10:16.949
I wanted to save him, but…

10:36.636 --> 10:37.762
I know.

10:39.722 --> 10:40.848
I get it.

10:41.849 --> 10:43.017
So

10:43.517 --> 10:45.102
please stop now.

10:46.354 --> 10:48.481
We'll all die at this rate.

11:07.500 --> 11:08.459
Master.

11:08.542 --> 11:11.504
Are you okay? Hey, open your eyes!

11:13.673 --> 11:14.632
Just go.

11:14.715 --> 11:17.885
What are you talking about?
I came back so we can return together!

11:17.968 --> 11:21.055
I'll just be a burden to you.

11:23.140 --> 11:23.974
Leave me here.

11:25.810 --> 11:26.894
Should we?

11:27.895 --> 11:30.064
Snap out of it, Choi Un-jeong!

11:32.233 --> 11:33.401
It's Lee Un-jeong.

11:35.778 --> 11:36.612
Ro-bin.

11:37.113 --> 11:39.240
You carry Master on your back!

11:39.740 --> 11:41.325
I can't do it.

11:41.409 --> 11:43.119
I have zero strength left.

11:44.328 --> 11:46.706
Me too. I don't even have the strength
to insult him.

11:47.289 --> 11:49.166
-I'm beat.
-Damn you two.

11:49.959 --> 11:50.876
Here we go.

11:57.216 --> 11:58.384
Hold onto me, everyone!

12:03.264 --> 12:04.849
Hey, Eun Chae-ni, wait. Wait, I--

12:18.821 --> 12:20.781
What… Where are we? Why are we here?

12:20.865 --> 12:23.075
It looks like a chapel.

12:23.617 --> 12:24.827
What do we do?

12:24.910 --> 12:27.371
We must still be
in the Church of Eternal Salvation!

12:28.080 --> 12:29.790
We were meant to go to Master's.

12:29.874 --> 12:32.710
I got distracted at the last minute
because of damn Mr. Son!

12:38.549 --> 12:40.634
I wouldn't even be here
if it wasn't for them!

12:40.718 --> 12:43.429
How could they whiz off
and leave me behind like that?

12:45.389 --> 12:48.559
This is crossing a line
even for you, Lady Trainwreck!

13:08.788 --> 13:10.247
This isn't fun at all.

13:10.331 --> 13:12.416
I'm scared to death.

13:14.835 --> 13:16.128
I don't want to die!

13:17.671 --> 13:20.174
I really don't want to die!

13:20.257 --> 13:24.345
I don't even know which lie made me stick.

13:25.262 --> 13:26.722
My arm hurt so much!

13:26.806 --> 13:30.434
It was so tiring! Exhausting!

13:33.479 --> 13:37.024
I had enough strength left
to carry Mr. Oddball on my back

13:37.107 --> 13:40.027
and run away.

14:06.136 --> 14:08.472
Chae-ni, what do we do now?

14:10.182 --> 14:14.144
The minute Master wakes up,
you get him out of here!

14:14.770 --> 14:18.440
And even if you do get out,
don't tell Grandma anything.

14:18.524 --> 14:19.984
She'll be so worried.

14:20.067 --> 14:21.527
She already knows.

14:22.903 --> 14:23.779
What?

14:24.905 --> 14:26.240
How?

14:26.323 --> 14:27.700
Why would you tell her?

14:27.783 --> 14:30.119
I didn't need to tell her
because she already knew.

14:30.202 --> 14:31.829
Your grandma knows everything!

14:31.912 --> 14:33.622
She even helped us with this plan!

14:36.500 --> 14:38.252
This is unbelievable.

14:38.335 --> 14:43.340
Well, anyway, you do whatever it takes
to get out of here! Don't get soft!

14:44.258 --> 14:46.760
I'll go back and find Royal Nightmare--

14:49.013 --> 14:50.431
Eun Chae-ni!

14:52.474 --> 14:53.517
Eun Chae-ni!

15:30.012 --> 15:31.263
What is that?

15:39.063 --> 15:41.732
Serum we obtained from that child.

15:41.815 --> 15:43.984
It won't be as potent
as the heart of eternity,

15:44.485 --> 15:48.197
but it should work as a booster
for cell regeneration.

15:48.280 --> 15:52.159
Just keeping your lungs from hardening
should make breathing easier.

15:52.868 --> 15:53.744
If

15:55.287 --> 15:57.873
something happens to me,

15:58.832 --> 16:02.211
kill them all as I previously ordered.

16:02.294 --> 16:03.379
Yes, sir!

16:07.925 --> 16:09.802
If you're confident,

16:10.552 --> 16:12.221
go ahead!

17:17.578 --> 17:18.412
Dr. Ha?

18:08.462 --> 18:09.338
What

18:10.798 --> 18:11.882
happened to me?

18:47.000 --> 18:48.752
Father, 3972 is--

18:52.005 --> 18:53.841
How are you feeling right now?

19:01.306 --> 19:02.808
I feel strong.

19:04.893 --> 19:06.520
And the pain is gone.

19:07.146 --> 19:08.689
It's even easier to breathe.

19:09.690 --> 19:11.275
All my movements

19:12.067 --> 19:13.569
feel sharp.

19:25.581 --> 19:27.124
Dr. Ha Won-do.

19:28.333 --> 19:29.376
You

19:30.210 --> 19:32.004
really did it.

19:35.048 --> 19:37.134
I can't believe this is possible.

19:41.763 --> 19:42.848
This is the moment

19:43.348 --> 19:46.643
I make history!

19:55.360 --> 19:56.528
Dr. Ha?

19:58.238 --> 20:00.032
The graph is spiking.

20:09.917 --> 20:13.587
What's wrong with my heart?
It's beating too fast.

20:15.172 --> 20:17.299
Bring me some amiodarone. Now!

20:26.516 --> 20:28.310
Mr. Nam, are you okay?

20:33.941 --> 20:35.359
Why is this happening?

20:35.984 --> 20:38.278
Has it already worn off?

20:41.573 --> 20:42.741
The serum.

20:42.824 --> 20:44.826
Bring me more of that drug you injected.

20:45.327 --> 20:47.871
That was all of the first batch
of serum we produced.

20:48.747 --> 20:52.251
Don't just stand there and gawk!
Do something!

20:58.507 --> 20:59.883
Ha Won-do.

21:00.759 --> 21:02.469
Did you do this on purpose?

21:06.974 --> 21:07.933
No.

21:08.684 --> 21:09.518
I

21:10.310 --> 21:12.604
deserve to live longer!

21:13.689 --> 21:16.358
I can't go out like this!

21:17.109 --> 21:20.070
I am the great Nam Sun-gyu!

21:20.570 --> 21:23.073
I achieved so much!

21:24.032 --> 21:25.617
Me!

21:26.201 --> 21:28.078
I, Nam Sun-gyu…

21:44.678 --> 21:45.887
What the…

21:55.939 --> 21:56.773
Don't move!

21:57.524 --> 21:58.734
Stop right there.

22:06.700 --> 22:10.537
You will not attack anyone in this room.

22:11.455 --> 22:13.457
And forget everything
that happened in here.

22:18.253 --> 22:20.047
Await your next orders outside.

22:20.630 --> 22:21.923
Everyone, outside.

22:29.639 --> 22:30.640
Father.

22:31.850 --> 22:32.851
Are you all right?

22:34.561 --> 22:36.897
Was the dosage the problem?

22:37.564 --> 22:40.734
The guinea pig's numbers were all fine.

22:41.485 --> 22:42.986
Or was it due to

22:43.487 --> 22:45.405
individual differences after all?

22:46.239 --> 22:48.241
What will you do
about Chairman Nam Sun-gyu?

22:49.534 --> 22:52.662
Though it was fleeting,
he got to experience youth again.

22:52.746 --> 22:54.790
He should be satisfied with that.

22:56.875 --> 23:00.212
In any case,
it was a meaningful experiment.

23:00.295 --> 23:02.506
I see hope on the horizon.

23:03.465 --> 23:07.177
Does that mean you can fix us now, Father?

23:08.512 --> 23:11.431
There are still questions
that need answering.

23:12.140 --> 23:15.560
To do that,
we need more of that child's blood.

23:17.938 --> 23:19.481
That crazy son of a…

23:29.157 --> 23:30.826
Wait, hold up!

23:43.463 --> 23:44.798
Ouch.

23:45.924 --> 23:46.967
Man, that hurts.

23:47.050 --> 23:49.803
That was freaky.
Could have gone totally south…

24:10.073 --> 24:11.158
I'm sorry, Father.

24:12.325 --> 24:13.285
Go catch her.

24:14.578 --> 24:18.165
The side effects have spread
to his shoulder, so he shouldn't push it.

24:18.248 --> 24:20.167
In life,

24:21.001 --> 24:25.964
there are times when the rest of your days
boil down to a single moment's decision.

24:29.176 --> 24:30.886
Now is such a time, Ju-ran.

24:32.679 --> 24:37.017
Will you die with your pain,
or will you fight to end it?

24:39.853 --> 24:40.854
You decide.

25:17.516 --> 25:18.850
Stay here. I'll do it.

25:20.393 --> 25:22.687
You're not my guardian. Stop interfering.

25:24.439 --> 25:27.317
And stop trying to stick up for me
in front of Father!

25:29.110 --> 25:31.112
It makes me look weaker than you.

25:31.196 --> 25:34.616
What if the side effects spread
and harden your heart?

25:35.617 --> 25:38.078
-Are you just going to die?
-Stay out of it!

25:38.912 --> 25:40.288
Listen to me!

25:41.581 --> 25:43.708
What, will you use your ability on me too?

25:44.709 --> 25:46.503
It wouldn't work anyway.

25:51.675 --> 25:53.218
Father gave me this.

25:53.718 --> 25:56.846
He made it specifically
to block out your ability.

25:59.558 --> 26:00.475
Father?

26:07.566 --> 26:08.692
Why would he…

26:08.775 --> 26:11.778
You always want to peer into
other people's thoughts.

26:11.861 --> 26:14.864
Even I know that.
Did you really think Father wouldn't?

26:15.949 --> 26:17.909
I just wanted to protect our family.

26:17.993 --> 26:19.494
Don't you mean control us?

26:25.500 --> 26:27.043
I don't want to die like this.

26:27.711 --> 26:29.129
So, Ju-ran…

26:31.131 --> 26:32.799
let's each do our part.

26:34.426 --> 26:35.635
Don't be suspicious.

26:35.719 --> 26:37.512
To protect our family,

26:38.513 --> 26:39.764
we need to trust Father.

27:25.101 --> 27:26.269
Fuck.

27:30.065 --> 27:31.191
I'm so pissed.

27:40.659 --> 27:43.411
What, never seen a person
drop from the sky before?

27:44.329 --> 27:46.164
What are you all staring at?

27:46.748 --> 27:48.833
How rude!

27:54.172 --> 27:55.507
Come here. Hurry.

27:55.590 --> 27:56.841
Why are you still…

28:01.930 --> 28:03.056
Be saved.

28:04.432 --> 28:06.184
Have a nice time.

28:07.977 --> 28:09.396
Gain eternal life.

28:09.896 --> 28:11.022
Eternal life.

28:12.857 --> 28:14.484
-Is that Trainwreck?
-Hearty House?

28:14.567 --> 28:18.238
-Why's that brat here?
-Why's the Trainwreck of Haeseong here?

28:18.321 --> 28:21.241
Bet she came here because she's scared
of the apocalypse too.

28:21.324 --> 28:23.993
What kind of ruckus
is she planning to cause here?

28:24.077 --> 28:25.662
She should stay out of trouble.

28:25.745 --> 28:27.831
Only natural to want to live.

28:33.420 --> 28:35.547
You must have cashed out a lot
as offerings.

28:38.007 --> 28:41.136
Where did you get the matching fits?

28:41.219 --> 28:43.304
Have you all got money to burn?

28:45.473 --> 28:47.016
But how unfortunate.

28:47.726 --> 28:51.688
Listen up, everyone.
There is no apocalypse.

28:53.106 --> 28:55.942
Even if you're sick of life,
you have to keep living.

28:56.025 --> 28:57.485
Don't give them your money!

28:59.571 --> 29:02.866
What will you all do
if the apocalypse doesn't come?

29:03.366 --> 29:04.242
By the way,

29:05.618 --> 29:09.205
do you all know that they're conducting
evil experiments down there?

29:10.582 --> 29:12.375
Don't regret it later,

29:12.876 --> 29:16.379
and please, just snap out of it
and go home now!

29:18.256 --> 29:19.299
You there.

29:19.382 --> 29:21.301
Mr. Heo, from the general store.

29:21.801 --> 29:24.679
And behind you,
even the hotteok lady is here.

29:24.763 --> 29:27.932
Why don't you go and sell
your hotteok instead?

29:28.516 --> 29:31.352
I said go home already!

29:47.410 --> 29:49.162
-What the…
-Can you hear me, believers?

29:51.080 --> 29:53.625
Outsiders who want to
bring down our church

29:53.708 --> 29:55.418
have infiltrated the building.

29:56.503 --> 29:58.797
The moment you find them,

29:59.297 --> 30:01.633
capture them and bring them
to the shepherd.

30:03.426 --> 30:05.595
You will be rewarded with grace.

30:12.018 --> 30:14.562
Begone, Church of Eternal Salvation!

30:14.646 --> 30:16.564
Begone!

30:17.398 --> 30:19.818
Return our children to us!

30:19.901 --> 30:22.153
Return them to us!

30:22.237 --> 30:24.781
Begone, Church of Eternal Salvation!

30:24.864 --> 30:27.200
Begone!

30:38.920 --> 30:41.130
I'm just passing through.

30:42.215 --> 30:43.925
May you receive eternal life.

30:44.884 --> 30:45.969
Why are you…

30:46.052 --> 30:48.096
Why are you doing this all of a sudden?

30:48.179 --> 30:49.055
Stay back, okay?

30:49.639 --> 30:51.808
Move while I'm still asking nicely.

30:51.891 --> 30:53.977
Or else I'll spit on you! Okay?

30:54.561 --> 30:56.604
I'm serious.

30:56.688 --> 30:57.856
I'll spit on you!

30:58.940 --> 30:59.774
What's with you?

31:00.358 --> 31:02.777
Stay back! Don't!
I don't make empty threats!

31:03.987 --> 31:05.446
Believers,

31:05.530 --> 31:09.242
let us all receive the reward of grace!

31:10.368 --> 31:11.286
Stay back!

31:12.579 --> 31:13.872
I told you to stay back.

31:13.955 --> 31:16.708
I said stay back! What are you doing?
You're freaking me out!

31:16.791 --> 31:18.126
Get a hold of yourselves!

31:18.793 --> 31:19.627
Ro-bin!

31:19.711 --> 31:21.754
Hurry. Take Master and run!

31:22.922 --> 31:24.215
I said run, you idiot!

31:49.032 --> 31:50.199
Master!

32:00.710 --> 32:01.669
Here's what we'll do.

32:02.170 --> 32:04.505
First, take Mr. Kang Ro-bin outside.

32:05.006 --> 32:08.176
When you come back, I'll hurl you outside.

32:09.218 --> 32:10.762
That's our only option.

32:10.845 --> 32:12.347
I'll find Mr. Son Gyeong-hun.

32:13.014 --> 32:13.848
I don't want to.

32:15.266 --> 32:16.184
Don't be stubborn.

32:16.267 --> 32:17.352
I said I don't want to.

32:19.896 --> 32:21.064
Let me save you.

32:22.023 --> 32:23.232
That's why I'm here.

32:24.901 --> 32:28.613
I won't let you be the only one
who looks cool. It makes me jealous.

32:29.530 --> 32:32.742
I'm the type
who'd prefer to save than be saved.

32:33.493 --> 32:34.494
Hey, Master!

32:35.328 --> 32:37.747
I think we should get out of here
as soon as possible.

33:24.419 --> 33:29.090
EPISODE 7
THE GUARDIANS OF HAESEONG CITY PART 1

33:30.049 --> 33:32.385
Give us back our families!

33:32.468 --> 33:34.387
Give them back!

33:35.388 --> 33:37.181
Yes, how did it go?

33:37.682 --> 33:39.559
Did you talk to the police chief?

33:39.642 --> 33:41.102
A total waste of breath.

33:41.602 --> 33:45.773
Looks like the church
buttered up the police chief too.

33:45.857 --> 33:48.109
If that's the case,
the police are useless too.

33:49.402 --> 33:51.320
What about on your end? Nothing yet?

33:51.404 --> 33:52.780
Give them back!

33:53.281 --> 33:54.741
There seems to be a delay.

33:54.824 --> 33:58.286
Even the followers who were outside
just went back in all of a sudden.

33:59.078 --> 34:01.789
I have a bad feeling about this.
What should we do?

34:03.624 --> 34:05.334
Your turn, babe!

34:05.418 --> 34:06.252
Do it!

34:08.171 --> 34:09.589
Do it. Go again.

34:09.672 --> 34:10.715
One more try.

34:12.425 --> 34:15.386
-Nice one!
-I hit it!

34:15.470 --> 34:17.889
Can we have this one here?

34:18.389 --> 34:20.850
Thank you. Have a nice evening.

34:22.185 --> 34:23.311
Jun-mo.

34:23.895 --> 34:25.396
We'd better go with Plan B.

34:25.897 --> 34:26.981
Get ready.

34:30.693 --> 34:32.028
Begone!

34:32.111 --> 34:34.489
Begone!

34:34.572 --> 34:36.824
Give us back our children!

34:36.908 --> 34:38.326
Okay, we're going with Plan B.

35:02.767 --> 35:04.519
You dare hang up on me?

35:08.147 --> 35:10.066
Is this for the parade tomorrow?

35:10.149 --> 35:12.735
It looks so good on you, Cheong!

35:14.904 --> 35:15.863
What about Dad?

35:16.364 --> 35:17.573
Is he still not home?

35:18.866 --> 35:21.786
Leave him be.
He's probably rolling around somewhere.

35:46.477 --> 35:49.480
Check the number of gas tanks here.
And move fast.

35:49.564 --> 35:50.565
Yes, will do.

35:50.648 --> 35:52.358
Move all the chemicals we can save.

36:06.497 --> 36:09.876
I'm not scared at all. Zero fear. Zilch.

36:10.376 --> 36:12.044
This is a piece of cake.

36:12.545 --> 36:14.130
It's honestly laughable.

36:15.464 --> 36:17.133
I'm terrified.

36:17.800 --> 36:19.427
I'm Song Dae-kwan.

36:20.303 --> 36:22.889
This is the hardest thing ever.
I'm tearing up.

36:23.389 --> 36:25.016
I'm Tae Jin-ah.

36:26.392 --> 36:27.602
I'm Son Gyeong-hun.

36:27.685 --> 36:29.687
I'm President Kim Dae-jung.

36:36.861 --> 36:38.696
I'm Lee Deok-hwa.

36:39.322 --> 36:40.364
I'm Son Gyeong-hun--

36:46.704 --> 36:48.873
-Hey, grab it.
-Yes, I'll grab this side.

36:48.956 --> 36:51.125
Okay, grab it properly. Now lift.

36:52.501 --> 36:55.421
Three, two, one.

37:15.983 --> 37:17.443
-Two, one.
-Two, one.

37:28.454 --> 37:31.415
Are we going ahead
with the apocalypse plan?

37:35.419 --> 37:37.964
The prophecy will be fulfilled as planned.

37:39.131 --> 37:40.925
Because that's where salvation begins.

37:44.178 --> 37:47.682
Is dousing the people of Haeseong
with a chemical…

37:49.767 --> 37:50.935
really salvation?

37:52.687 --> 37:53.729
What do you mean?

37:57.149 --> 38:02.321
I believed Dad would save us,
but I'm not so sure anymore.

38:05.825 --> 38:07.076
Can't we just

38:07.868 --> 38:09.578
leave this place?

38:10.579 --> 38:13.124
We can't betray Father.

38:13.958 --> 38:16.502
We will never leave.

38:17.545 --> 38:18.587
Why not?

38:19.797 --> 38:20.631
Why?

38:27.888 --> 38:29.640
This is why.

38:30.808 --> 38:33.436
Because Father is the only one
who will protect us.

38:39.191 --> 38:40.943
Leave before it's too late.

38:41.027 --> 38:42.611
And be careful not to get hurt.

38:44.780 --> 38:46.032
You still think I'm a kid.

38:48.909 --> 38:50.328
Look after Pal-ho.

38:52.413 --> 38:53.456
Let's go.

38:54.248 --> 38:55.124
Open it.

39:02.631 --> 39:03.799
The apocalypse?

39:06.469 --> 39:07.678
That's great.

39:08.179 --> 39:09.555
The apocalypse.

39:10.890 --> 39:15.353
If they douse Haeseong with that chemical,
what will become of my dear Moon Mi-hui?

39:17.396 --> 39:19.565
What about my darling Cheong?

39:31.869 --> 39:33.204
That'll be fun.

39:33.704 --> 39:36.207
A family of defectives.

39:45.091 --> 39:46.467
It'll be so

39:47.051 --> 39:48.094
goddamn

39:48.594 --> 39:50.638
ridiculously fun!

40:11.367 --> 40:12.827
Ro-bin!

40:20.000 --> 40:21.127
Go.

40:23.629 --> 40:24.713
Go.

40:26.090 --> 40:27.299
Go!

40:39.061 --> 40:40.187
I'm safe.

40:41.063 --> 40:42.606
Thank you, Master.

40:46.235 --> 40:48.779
Great. You did well, Kang Ro-bin.

40:49.488 --> 40:53.159
For a guy this out of shape who once
landed in the ER after a 100-meter run,

40:53.659 --> 40:55.202
you did a pretty good job.

40:55.286 --> 40:56.328
Kudos.

41:06.505 --> 41:08.841
So you somehow managed to get this far.

41:09.341 --> 41:11.260
Now stop playing hide-and-seek

41:12.470 --> 41:13.387
and hand her over.

41:14.763 --> 41:15.598
Ms. Eun Chae-ni.

41:16.098 --> 41:17.975
Take Mr. Kang Ro-bin and go.

41:19.018 --> 41:22.229
But, Master, I'm going to end up
back here anyway.

41:22.313 --> 41:23.397
Exactly.

41:24.356 --> 41:26.192
First, get Mr. Kang Ro-bin out of here,

41:27.651 --> 41:28.903
then come back

41:29.653 --> 41:30.613
and help me.

41:33.991 --> 41:35.201
Hang in there

41:35.910 --> 41:37.203
until I get back.

41:45.878 --> 41:47.588
I've clocked her pattern.

41:47.671 --> 41:50.090
Even if she gets away,
she'll end up back here.

41:51.300 --> 41:52.843
Like a broken blinker.

41:55.262 --> 41:56.305
Which is why I intend…

41:59.141 --> 42:00.559
to end this before she returns.

42:10.319 --> 42:12.238
Ro-bin, I managed to make it
to your place.

42:13.948 --> 42:14.782
A weapon.

42:16.283 --> 42:17.243
A weapon.

42:21.580 --> 42:23.082
Would these help?

42:49.358 --> 42:50.317
A weapon.

42:50.401 --> 42:52.486
A weapon!

42:52.570 --> 42:54.446
Have anything that I can use as a weapon?

42:54.530 --> 42:56.907
A weapon.
Anything that can be used as a weapon.

42:56.991 --> 42:58.534
Anything that might help.

44:01.889 --> 44:03.724
HARDWARE, BUILDING MATERIALS

44:05.100 --> 44:06.477
That's more like it.

44:25.746 --> 44:27.539
Why are you going this far?

44:29.208 --> 44:30.959
You're dying too.

44:32.127 --> 44:35.756
Don't you know that we can all live
if we offer that child up?

44:38.842 --> 44:41.637
A life that you can only live
by killing someone.

44:43.013 --> 44:44.098
A bit low, isn't it?

44:49.311 --> 44:51.397
It's not like you don't know

44:51.980 --> 44:53.315
why we ended up like this.

44:55.776 --> 44:57.236
Doesn't it piss you off?

44:59.154 --> 45:01.240
You're doing exactly what they did to us.

45:01.323 --> 45:03.117
Stop acting all high and mighty.

45:04.076 --> 45:07.705
You offered that child up
to find your mom.

45:09.832 --> 45:11.500
It didn't really matter to me…

45:14.044 --> 45:15.879
whatever Ha Won-do was doing again…

45:18.382 --> 45:19.591
or what happened to that child.

45:23.303 --> 45:26.140
Then stay out of this
and piss off, you bastard.

45:28.600 --> 45:29.560
I should.

45:32.396 --> 45:34.064
I'd like to…

45:36.650 --> 45:37.693
but I can't.

45:39.403 --> 45:40.279
Why not?

45:42.406 --> 45:44.742
Did you get attached to those losers?

45:47.494 --> 45:48.662
I wonder.

45:51.665 --> 45:52.708
Did I?

45:52.791 --> 45:55.502
You fucking idiot.

45:57.796 --> 45:58.964
So…

46:01.341 --> 46:02.843
kill me right here.

46:04.303 --> 46:05.929
Or you'll be the one to die.

48:22.274 --> 48:24.192
Move aside!

48:30.949 --> 48:32.242
Get back!

48:59.436 --> 49:01.438
Lady Trainwreck!

49:02.272 --> 49:05.025
-Lady Trainwreck. You came to save--
-Move aside!

49:05.108 --> 49:07.986
Move aside, damn it.
Don't come any closer, okay?

49:08.070 --> 49:09.529
Go! Run away!

49:09.613 --> 49:10.489
Get lost!

49:11.573 --> 49:12.991
Block the door for now!

49:13.075 --> 49:15.452
Why?

49:15.535 --> 49:17.454
Why?

49:18.789 --> 49:19.915
Move out of the way!

49:25.337 --> 49:26.546
What are you doing?

49:26.630 --> 49:27.839
Get over here!

49:28.632 --> 49:30.133
Hurry!

49:39.059 --> 49:39.893
You bastard, you--

49:39.977 --> 49:41.520
Perfect timing!

49:48.986 --> 49:51.405
Master! I'm here!

50:01.289 --> 50:02.374
Master?

50:12.968 --> 50:14.177
Master.

50:17.014 --> 50:17.848
Let's go.

50:17.931 --> 50:19.558
We have to get out of here.

50:19.641 --> 50:20.851
We find Master first.

50:20.934 --> 50:22.185
Are you crazy? No!

50:23.145 --> 50:24.146
I'm out!

50:24.896 --> 50:28.108
I came to save your life,
yet you're going to run away by yourself?

50:28.191 --> 50:29.776
Hey, let's get the facts straight.

50:29.860 --> 50:31.486
I came in here to save you,

50:31.570 --> 50:34.990
and you ditched me and ran away
with Ro-bin and Oddball!

50:35.073 --> 50:38.118
So I came back, didn't I?
You should be grateful I saved you!

50:38.201 --> 50:42.664
Which is why I'm going to get out of here
while I'm still alive. Now, right now!

50:43.165 --> 50:45.000
But Master is alone right now!

50:45.083 --> 50:47.836
The apocalypse is nigh for Haeseong!

50:48.628 --> 50:50.255
A real apocalypse!

50:56.553 --> 50:58.180
Mr. Son, no way.

50:59.431 --> 51:00.932
Have you become a believer?

51:02.225 --> 51:03.101
Since when?

51:03.185 --> 51:04.811
How did that happen?

51:05.395 --> 51:07.439
I heard it with my own ears.

51:07.939 --> 51:11.568
Those people, those crazy people,
said they're going to destroy Haeseong.

51:12.569 --> 51:13.904
That chemical,

51:13.987 --> 51:15.072
that phenol!

51:15.572 --> 51:17.574
They're going to spray it
all over Haeseong.

51:17.657 --> 51:20.118
On every single person in Haeseong!

51:20.911 --> 51:25.082
Everyone, including my dear Moon Mi-hui
and darling Cheong.

51:55.362 --> 51:56.488
Let's go.

52:10.502 --> 52:11.670
Shepherd!

52:12.504 --> 52:13.463
No.

52:28.395 --> 52:29.312
Pal-ho?

52:31.648 --> 52:32.774
Ju-ran.

52:35.193 --> 52:36.194
What do I do?

52:39.030 --> 52:40.157
Father will be…

52:42.826 --> 52:44.494
disappointed in me again.

53:12.105 --> 53:14.274
Kim Pal-ho, our shepherd,

53:14.816 --> 53:16.401
has been martyred.

53:19.571 --> 53:21.406
Shepherd!

53:22.490 --> 53:23.575
Shepherd!

53:29.497 --> 53:30.916
Shepherd!

53:32.334 --> 53:34.127
Shepherd!

53:44.179 --> 53:45.722
What do we do, Eun Chae-ni?

53:46.223 --> 53:48.350
We're all doomed now.

54:19.297 --> 54:23.009
An apocalypse really is coming.

55:03.758 --> 55:07.137
HAESEONG MILLENNIUM FIREWORKS FESTIVAL
DATE: DECEMBER 31, 1999

58:33.301 --> 58:38.306
Subtitle translation by: Jimin Choi
